Modding and Scripting API for a custom long range, low cpu usage ore detection algorithm.
See [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=TBD] Ore Detector Reforged GPS [/url] for the player focused mod.

[h2] Planets [/h2]
[list]
[*]_mat.png is used to find the ore locations - voxels are only checked strategically (7-15m resolution)
[*]First scan time: ~1s per planet face
[*]Biome related layers (lakes, oasis, ice caps) are not supported
[*]Horizontally nearest ores are searched (Not necessarily nearest in 3D)
[/list]

[h2] Asteroids [/h2]
Initial full scan at a low accuracy (16m) resolution: small or partial veins can be missed 

[h2] Scripting [/h2]
[code]
public void Main(string argument, UpdateType updateSource)
{
	var area = new BoundingSphereD(Me.GetPosition(), 15000);
	Action<Vector3D, Exception> callBack = (v, e) => Me.CustomData = e?.ToString() ?? v.ToString();
	Me.SetValue("DetectOre", new MyTuple<BoundingSphereD, string, Action<Vector3D, Exception>>(area, "Nickel", callBack));
}
[/code]

